!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 9606
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell line: TIME
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = treatment: Uninfected
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell status: Live
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = CRISPR library transduced, followed by puromycin selection, then KSHV infection where indicated. Passaged for 8 days.
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = Grown in EBM2 with Bullet kit from Lonza, details in methods.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = genomic DNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Qiagen Blood and Cell Culture DNA Maxi Kit.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = PCR using primers flanking sgRNA encoding sequence in the CRISPR Lentivirus library, followed by gel purification.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Read 1 followed by index reading with a custom indexing primer.
!Sample_description = Mock_Live
!Sample_description = processed data file: Live_Cell_CRISPR_Screen.xlsx
!Sample_data_processing = Deconvolution
!Sample_data_processing = Read mapping and counting to library file to generate list of sgRNA counts per sample using MAGeCK.
!Sample_data_processing = Testing using MAGeCK to identify sgRNAs which are significantly depleted or enriched between sample populations.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: Mapping was to an included library file, not a genome.
